fin-foundation:FinancialAccountShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "account that identifies a governed cash, securities-custody, or multi-asset holding capability. Logical identity is exactly (accountIdentifierScheme logical IRI, accountIdentifierValue logical IRI). accountType is version content: changing it creates a new account version, never a new logical account. The scheme kind must be financialAccount, the value must be LocalIdentifierValue, value.scheme must equal accountIdentifierScheme, and a PIT-eligible assigning-authority authorization must cover the account version.";
    sh:name "Financial Account";
