    sh:description "immutable version of an ISO 4217 registry assertion for one registry authority and alphabetic code, carrying the numeric code, minor unit, registry status, locked source reference, and the Currency represented by the entry. Its logical identity is exactly (registry-authority logical IRI, alphabetic code); a registry snapshot is provenance and version content rather than business identity.";
